<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryland cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryland cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Ryland Group to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 15-1/4 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
